		<title>By: Zubin Nur Westrik</title>
		<link>http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=399&#038;cpage=1#comment-32</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Zubin Nur Westrik]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 27 Mar 2009 07:50:59 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=399#comment-32</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Noor-un-nisa gentle traveller
With courage strong and bright
Noor-un-nisa wise and bold
You held Inayat&#039;s Light

Noor-un-nisa joy and laughter
Fearlessly rocked the boat
Noor-un-nisa loving Sister
The memories afloat

Sharing gatherings and Federation
Just walking on the beach
Wisdoms&#039; loving light
Was there within your reach

Beloved Sufi Sister
You live on in our hearts
All the joy and light you shared
Illuminates darker parts

Your light and smiling radiance
The joy of being near
Such a Sufi Sister
Will remain always dear]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Noor-un-nisa gentle traveller<br />
With courage strong and bright<br />
Noor-un-nisa wise and bold<br />
You held Inayat&#8217;s Light</p>
<p>Noor-un-nisa joy and laughter<br />
Fearlessly rocked the boat<br />
Noor-un-nisa loving Sister<br />
The memories afloat</p>
<p>Sharing gatherings and Federation<br />
Just walking on the beach<br />
Wisdoms&#8217; loving light<br />
Was there within your reach</p>
<p>Beloved Sufi Sister<br />
You live on in our hearts<br />
All the joy and light you shared<br />
Illuminates darker parts</p>
<p>Your light and smiling radiance<br />
The joy of being near<br />
Such a Sufi Sister<br />
Will remain always dear</p>
]]></content:encoded>
